# Smoke tests — LLM Gateway (edge → gateway → Azure provider)
# Environment: local
#
# Prerequisites:
#   make up
#   Run mint-token.http first (or the mint block below)
#
# Expected for every request below:
#   HTTP 200
#   choices[0].message.content == "OK"   (chat completion contract)
#
# Responses-only models (gpt-5-mini, gpt-5.1-codex-mini) use the gateway bridge:
#   chat/completions → Azure Responses API → chat/completions response

@smokeInput = {{smokeInput}}

### 0) Mint token (skip if mint-token.http already run)
# @name mintDevToken
POST {{devIdpHost}}/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audience": "{{edgeAudience}}",
  "claims": {
    "appid": "seed-sp-appid",
    "idtyp": "app",
    "roles": "proj1"
  }
}

### Health — edge
GET {{edgeHost}}/health

### Ready — gateway via edge
GET {{edgeHost}}/ready

### 1) gpt-4.1 — azure-openai chat-completions
# @name smokeGpt41
POST {{edgeHost}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{mintDevToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4.1",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "{{smokeInput}}" }
  ],
  "stream": false
}

### 2) gpt-5-mini — azure-openai responses (via chat bridge)
# @name smokeGpt5Mini
POST {{edgeHost}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{mintDevToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-5-mini",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "{{smokeInput}}" }
  ],
  "stream": false
}

### 3) gpt-5.1-codex-mini — azure-openai responses (via chat bridge)
# @name smokeCodexMini
POST {{edgeHost}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{mintDevToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-5.1-codex-mini",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "{{smokeInput}}" }
  ],
  "stream": false
}

### 4) DeepSeek-V4-Flash — azure-foundry chat-completions
# @name smokeDeepSeek
POST {{edgeHost}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{mintDevToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "{{smokeInput}}" }
  ],
  "stream": false
}

### 5) Kimi-K2.5 — azure-foundry chat-completions
# @name smokeKimi
POST {{edgeHost}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{mintDevToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Kimi-K2.5",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "{{smokeInput}}" }
  ],
  "stream": false
}

### 6) Native Responses route — gpt-5-mini (no chat bridge on response shape)
# @name smokeResponsesNative
POST {{edgeHost}}/v1/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{mintDevToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-5-mini",
  "input": "{{smokeInput}}",
  "stream": false
}

### 7) Negative — unknown model (expect 403)
POST {{edgeHost}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{mintDevToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "unknown-model",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "hi" }
  ]
}
